<title>ITALY: CYCLING-DI GRANDE WINS 12TH STAGE OF GIRO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DI GRANDE WINS 12TH STAGE OF GIRO.</headline>
<dateline>VARAZZE, Italy 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giuseppe Di Grande won the 212-km 12th stage of the Giro d'Italia cycling race on Thursday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Marcos Serrano of Spain was second and Alexandre Shefer of Kazakhstan third, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Russia's Pavel Tonkov retained the overall race leader's pink jersey.</p>
